  "ipa": [
    "ɪkˈsept"
  ],
  "levelMark": true,
  "senses": [
    {
      "pos": "prep.",
      "zh": "除……之外"
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "I think no one can help me "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "except"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " you."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "我想除了你之外没有人能帮助我。"
    },
    {
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Everyone in our class has brought his dictionary to class "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "except"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " me."
        }
      ],
      "zh": "除了我以外，我们班上每个人都带了词典到教室。"
    }
  ],
  "tip": [
    {
      "id": "p1",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "except 是常考单词，所以学生一定要掌握 besides, except, except for 之间的用法区别："
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "besides"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 作“除……之外”时，表示“另外附加”的含义，相当于“加法”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "except"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 用于表示同类事物之间的关系，其意为“除……以外”“除去”。常用在 all, whole, any, every, no, anything, anybody, anyone, everything, everybody, everyone 等词之后，相当于“减法”。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p4",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "strong",
          "v": "except for"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " 不表示同类事物之间的关系，for 后面的词，往往是补充说明主语的某个方面。可以理解成有点“美中不足”的意思，肯定了一个事物的大部分属性，只否定其中的一小部分。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "例如：Jack also went fishing "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "besides"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Tom. 除了汤姆，杰克也去钓鱼了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p6",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "We "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "all"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " went fishing "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "except"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " Tom. 除了汤姆，我们都去钓鱼了。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "The article is excellent, "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "except for"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " a few grammar mistakes."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "这篇文章很好，除了有点语法错误。（语法错误和文章不是同类事物）"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "p8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "Smith is a good man, "
        },
        {
          "t": "underline",
          "v": "except for"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": " his bad temper."
        },
        {
          "t": "br"
        },
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "史密斯是个好人，就是脾气不好。"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
